### Dependency Gate

The lockfile delivered by Lovable defines the approved dependency baseline.
**Adding any new runtime dependency after adoption requires Architect approval
recorded as an ADR note** — the single-file rule is gone, but uncontrolled
dependency growth is how bundles die. CDN-loaded resources of any kind are
forbidden (ADR-007): everything ships in the bundle.

